{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0219","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000041:text","row":29961,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"そうだな。","en":"Let's see.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800766","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00001","en":"Right, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000063:text","row":29962,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"一年教室に行こう。","en":"I’d try the first-year classroom next.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800767","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00002","en":"Let's go to the First Years' classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000008d:text","row":29963,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"ミキリコンビがいるかも知れない。","en":"The Miki-Kiri duo might be there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800768","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00003","en":"The Mikiri duo might just be around.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000196:text","row":29964,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"誰もいない。","en":"Nobody there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800769","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00004","en":"There is no one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000001ba:text","row":29965,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"見ると、二人の机に荷物は置いてあった。","en":"But their bags were sitting on their desks.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800770","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00005","en":"Looking closer, their bags have been laid on their desks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000001f8:text","row":29966,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"来てはいる。","en":"So they were here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800771","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00006","en":"They did come by.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000021c:text","row":29967,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"校内のどこかにいるのだろうか。","en":"Maybe they were somewhere else in the school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800772","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00007","en":"They should be somewhere on school grounds then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000252:text","row":29968,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"考えれば、霧と美希の家の中間地点に、学校はある。","en":"Come to think of it, the school stood halfway between Miki's house and Kiri's.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800773","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00008","en":"Thinking over it, school is the midway point between Kiri and Miki's houses.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000029a:text","row":29969,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"待ち合わせに、通い慣れた学校はちょうどいいのかも知れない。","en":"They knew the school inside and out, so maybe it made the perfect meeting place.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800774","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00009","en":"That school they're used to go back and forth from might be just right as a meeting point, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000002ec:text","row":29970,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"何をするにでもだ。","en":"No matter what they planned on doing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800775","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00010","en":"But to do what?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the location works for doing anything, not that the narrator is asking what the pair will do.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":15,"start":0,"text":"But to do what?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000316:text","row":29971,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から外を見る。","en":"I looked out the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800776","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00011","en":"I look outside from the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000033e:text","row":29972,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"プールが見えた。","en":"The pool was in view.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800777","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00012","en":"I could see the pool.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000451:text","row":29973,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「……へえ」","en":"“...Well, well.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800778","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00013","en":"Taichi: \"...ehhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000475:text","row":29974,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"遊んでいた。","en":"They were playing.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800779","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00014","en":"They were playing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000499:text","row":29975,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"楽しげに。","en":"Happily.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800780","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00015","en":"Cheerfully.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000004bb:text","row":29976,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"かすかな声が届く。","en":"Their faint voices drifted up to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800781","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00016","en":"Faint voices reach me:","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000050a:text","row":29977,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「そりゃー！」","en":"“Take that!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800782","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00017","en":"Miki: \"S'oryaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000553:text","row":29978,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、だめだってば、だめー！」","en":"“Ah, no! Stop, stop!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800783","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00018","en":"Kiri: \"Ah, I said don't, dooon't!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000005ae:text","row":29979,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「そらそらー、よけることもできないかー！」","en":"“Come on! Can't you even dodge?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800784","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00019","en":"Miki: \"Soh'ra-Soh'raaa, then you can't even avoid iiit?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000613:text","row":29980,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって水の中じゃないっ、あっ、髪濡れる、濡れちゃうからっ」","en":"“But we're in the water! Ah—my hair! You'll get it wet!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800785","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00020","en":"Kiri: \"But we're into water aren't w-, AH! You'll wet my hair, you'll get them wet!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000068c:text","row":29981,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「どこが濡れるってーっ？」","en":"“What, exactly, is getting wet?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800786","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00021","en":"Miki: \"Were am I getting you weeet?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","grammar"],"assessment":"The English uses 'Were' where the question requires 'Where.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":11,"start":7,"text":"Were"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000006e1:text","row":29982,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんかオジサンっぽい」","en":"“You sound like an old man.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800787","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00022","en":"Kiri: \"Why like an old lech now...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the remark sounds like an older man's; the English adds lechery and an unsupported interrogative framing.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":35,"start":0,"text":"Kiri: \"Why like an old lech now...\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000736:text","row":29983,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「心はおじさんなの、てりゃー！」","en":"“I'm an old man at heart! Hyaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800788","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00023","en":"Miki: \"I have the heart of an old lech, TEH'RYAAA!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the speaker is an older man at heart; the highlighted sexual characterization is added.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":30,"text":"old lech"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000791:text","row":29984,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、髪がー」","en":"“Ahh, my hair!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800789","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00024","en":"Kiri: \"Ah, my haaair!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000007dc:text","row":29985,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかえしっ！」","en":"“Payback!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800790","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00025","en":"Kiri: \"Vengeance!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000829:text","row":29986,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「きゃー！」","en":"“Eek!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800791","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00026","en":"Miki: \"Kyaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000084d:text","row":29987,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"幸せな光景を見ていた。","en":"It was a happy sight.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800792","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00027","en":"I was looking at a happy scene.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000089e:text","row":29988,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「んのー！」","en":"“Nnngh!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800793","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00028","en":"Kiri: \"'llyyy!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000008e7:text","row":29989,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「てりゃりゃー！」","en":"“Hya-hyaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800794","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00029","en":"Miki: \"Teh'rya'ryaaa!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000934:text","row":29990,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「くらえー！！」","en":"“Take this!!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800795","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00030","en":"Kiri: \"Drink thiiis!!!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese battle cry means 'Take this,' not an instruction to drink.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":7,"text":"Drink thiiis"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000981:text","row":29991,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわー……なーんて、くらわないもーん」","en":"“Waaah... psych! Didn't get me!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800796","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00031","en":"Miki: \"Waaah... buuut, I ain't gonna driiink!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The Japanese replies that the attack will not land; rendering the repeated verb as drinking breaks the exchange.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":37,"text":"driiink"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000009e4:text","row":29992,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、ビート板使うの禁止！」","en":"“No kickboards! That's cheating!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800797","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00032","en":"Kiri: \"Ah, kickboard usage is forbidden!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000a3d:text","row":29993,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「楯だよー」","en":"“It's my shield!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800798","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00033","en":"Miki: \"It's my shield!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000a84:text","row":29994,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずるー！」","en":"“No fair!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800799","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00034","en":"Kiri: \"Cheeeat!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000acd:text","row":29995,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「髪の長さが違う分、ハンデいるもん」","en":"“My hair's longer, so I deserve a handicap!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800800","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00035","en":"Miki: \"The length of my hear is different, so I gotta have a handicap!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"assessment":"The English has 'hear' where the Japanese and sentence require 'hair.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":24,"text":"hear"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000b09:text","row":29996,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"なんだよそりゃ。","en":"What kind of logic was that?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800801","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00036","en":"What's even that mean.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000b31:text","row":29997,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"苦笑してしまう。","en":"I couldn't help a wry smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800802","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00037","en":"I end up with a strained smile.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000b7c:text","row":29998,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「けど、片手になった分、攻撃力は下がってる！」","en":"“But that leaves you one-handed, so your attack power's down!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800803","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00038","en":"Kiri: \"But now that one of your hands got busy, your offensive abilities have decreased!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000be7:text","row":29999,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「しもうたー！」","en":"“Curses!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800804","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00039","en":"Miki: \"Daymn iiit!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000c32:text","row":30000,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「狩りの時間だー！」","en":"“The hunt begins!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800805","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00040","en":"Kiri: \"Time to hunt!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000c83:text","row":30001,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「狩猟解禁！？」","en":"“Open season?!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800806","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00041","en":"Miki: \"They rescinded the hunting prohibition?!","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"assessment":"The English dialogue opens a quotation but does not close it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"They rescinded the hunting prohibition?!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000cab:text","row":30002,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"ざぶざぶと動き回りながら、水をかけあう。","en":"They sloshed around the pool, splashing each other.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800807","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00042","en":"Splashing and splashing around they toss water onto each other.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000ceb:text","row":30003,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"無邪気なもんだ。","en":"So innocent.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800808","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00043","en":"It's so innocent.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000d18:text","row":30004,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"トクン","en":"Thump.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800809","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00044","en":"Badump.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000d3e:text","row":30005,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800810","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00045","en":"Taichi: \"...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000d60:text","row":30006,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"心臓が跳ねた。","en":"My heart leaped.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800811","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00046","en":"My physical heart took a leap.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000d86:text","row":30007,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"軽く胸を打たれて。","en":"A soft knock against my chest.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800812","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00047","en":"My chest was struck, lightly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000db0:text","row":30008,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"無意識に心臓を押さえた。","en":"Without thinking, I pressed a hand over my heart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800813","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00048","en":"Unconsciously I was pressing onto my heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000de0:text","row":30009,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"臓器に心があるわけではない。","en":"Feelings don't live in the organ itself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800814","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00049","en":"But the heart, as in the spirit, is not inside my internal organs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000e14:text","row":30010,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の感じたことが、心臓さえノックしてのけた。","en":"But what I’d felt had knocked on my heart all the same.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800815","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00050","en":"What I had felt gave a knock onto my physical heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000e58:text","row":30011,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"そのことが嬉しかった。","en":"I was glad.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800816","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00051","en":"I was happy it did.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000ea9:text","row":30012,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「きゃあっ！」","en":"“Aah!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800817","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00052","en":"Kiri: \"KyAaAh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000f12:text","row":30013,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「あははははっ、転んだー！」","en":"“Hahahaha! You fell!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800818","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00053","en":"Miki: \"Ahahahahah, you feeell!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the other person fell; the highlighted spelling produces 'feel' instead.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":23,"text":"feeell"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000f69:text","row":30014,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずぶぬれぇ……」","en":"“I'm soaked...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800819","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00054","en":"Kiri: \"I'm soaked...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00000fb8:text","row":30015,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「どんくさーい、にぶーい」","en":"“Klutz! Slowpoke!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800820","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00055","en":"Miki: \"Sluuuggish, slooow!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000100d:text","row":30016,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「……言ったなぁ」","en":"“...Oh, you did not.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800821","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00056","en":"Kiri: \"...now you said iiit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000105c:text","row":30017,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「おひょ？」","en":"“Uh-oh?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800822","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00057","en":"Miki: \"Oyoh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000010a3:text","row":30018,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「濡れたらもう泳げるもんね」","en":"“Now that I’m wet, I can swim after you.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800823","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00058","en":"Kiri: \"I'm all wet so I might as well swim.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000010fc:text","row":30019,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、あっあっ、接近戦はだめー！」","en":"“Ah! Ah! No close combat!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800824","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00059","en":"Miki: \"Ah, ah-ah, close quarters combat nooo!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000115b:text","row":30020,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「平泳ぎでクロールに勝てるもんかぁ！」","en":"“Your breaststroke doesn't stand a chance against my crawl!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800825","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00060","en":"Kiri: \"You think you can beat crawl with breast stroke?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000011be:text","row":30021,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「あたふたあたふたっ」","en":"“P-panic! Panic!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800826","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00061","en":"Miki: \"Hurry-ingly-pani-icky!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000120f:text","row":30022,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「水浸しにしてやるっ」","en":"“I’ll drench you!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800827","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00062","en":"Kiri: \"I'll plunge you down!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese threat is to drench the other person; 'plunge you down' describes a different action.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":29,"start":0,"text":"Kiri: \"I'll plunge you down!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00001262:text","row":30023,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「だめー！　濡れたら髪がワカメになるー！」","en":"“No! If my hair gets wet, it’ll turn into wakame seaweed!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800828","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00063","en":"Miki: \"Nooo! If you wet my hear it'll turn into Wakame seaweed!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"assessment":"The English has 'hear' where the Japanese and sentence require 'hair.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":27,"text":"hear"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000012c7:text","row":30024,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「ワカメちゃんにしてやるー！」","en":"“Then Little Miss Wakame it is!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800829","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00064","en":"Kiri: \"I'll make you into Wakame-chan theeen!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00001322:text","row":30025,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっ、わっ、まずっ」","en":"“W-wait—bad, bad!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800830","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00065","en":"Miki: \"Wah, wah, bad!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00001373:text","row":30026,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「そらー！」","en":"“Take that!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800831","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00066","en":"Kiri: \"Soh'raaa!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000013bc:text","row":30027,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぎにゃーーーーーーー！！」","en":"“GNYAAAAAAAAAAAH!!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800832","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00067","en":"Miki: \"Myeeeeeeeeow!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000013f0:text","row":30028,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"弾ける水の音。","en":"Water burst in a spray.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800833","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00068","en":"Sounds of water bursts.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:00001416:text","row":30029,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"とめどない笑声。","en":"Their laughter went on and on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800834","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00069","en":"Ceaseless laughter.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000143e:text","row":30030,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"やんわりと流れる時間を思わせて、優しい。","en":"Gentle as time drifting softly by.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800835","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00070","en":"A gentleness that reminds of the soft flowing of hours.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000147e:text","row":30031,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"優しい世界の一場面。","en":"A moment from a gentle world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800836","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00071","en":"A scene from a gentle world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000014aa:text","row":30032,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"日記に書こうと思った。","en":"I thought I’d write it in the diary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800837","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00072","en":"I thought I would write this in the diary,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:000014d8:text","row":30033,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"この気持ちを、忘れないよう。","en":"So I wouldn't forget this feeling.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800838","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00073","en":"so that I would never forget these emotions.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0219:0000150c:text","row":30034,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はずっと、二人の少女が戯れる様子を眺めていた。","en":"I stood there for a long time, watching the two girls play.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800839","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00074","en":"And I, all throughout, gazed at these two girls lost in their playfulness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
